Keep your loved ones safe, stay connected with them, and follow your device’s location from any place with Phone Locator 360. The only thing you need to track your friends, family and device’s location is a phone number. Type in the numbers, create smart circles and locate your people from every corner of the world.

Phone Locator 360’s features:

- Track your kids’ route to school;
- Share your location on a family map;
- Find your relatives just by their phone number, even if the app is not installed on their device;
- Monitor the battery level of your friends and family's phones;
- Enjoy the app with high security of your private data.

Smart circles:

- Create a circle of places or people who share their locations;
- Invite group members by sharing a unique code number;
- Edit profiles of a circle members, remove members or delete a circle completely;
- Customize notifications within a particular circle;
- Hide your current location or set up a fake one.

In the app you can have peace of mind knowing that your family is safe and that you can always stay in touch and locate your device when needed.

Subscription conditions:

- After you subscribe, you can manage your account and turn off automatic renewal in Account Settings.
- Your subscription is renewed automatically if you do not cancel it within 24 hours before its expiration date.
- When you purchase the app, your iTunes account is billed.
- Subscription fees: 1 week subscription - $8.99
- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.
- Automatic renewals will cost the actual price shown in Subscription conditions section.
- Any unused time left on your trial subscription will disappear if you upgrade to the paid version.
- Your personal data is stored securely.
- Privacy Policy: https://mobystardev.wixsite.com/ph-loc/privacy-policy
- Terms of Use: https://mobystardev.wixsite.com/ph-loc/terms-of-use

CTM BusFinder is the Official App of CTM SpA that guides you during your trips in the Area of Cagliari.

Through the App, CTM does not access to any of your  personal data stored in the device.

With CTM BusFinder you can:
- Read the last news retrieved from the CTM site and Twitter account;
- See the route of the bus lines on the map with the list of bus stops and schedules;
- Plan your journey to reach your destinations  and see the details about the relevant bus stops;
- See the bus stops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Consult the real-time data about the next bus transits and the relevant routes with reference to a bus stop of interest, also using a QR code reader; 
- See the list of ticket shops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Manage a list of preferred bus stops for a quick access;
- Purchase CTM single and season electronic tickets;
- Validate electronic tickets by scanning QR codes in CTM buses.
